WEBVTT

01:18.380 --> 01:21.780
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.920 --> 01:24.850
[Episode 24]

01:25.320 --> 01:26.920
I was just worried about you.

01:28.150 --> 01:28.920
Also,

01:29.430 --> 01:31.960
will I always be no more than
a stranger to you?

01:33.509 --> 01:35.229
Actually, I wanted to ask you,

01:35.479 --> 01:36.920
why did you spend New Year's Eve

01:36.920 --> 01:38.560
with your landlady?

01:38.840 --> 01:39.960
Was it really because she drank too much

01:39.960 --> 01:41.509
and you had to take her home?

01:42.039 --> 01:44.509
Didn't you say you hate it
when women drink,

01:44.710 --> 01:47.170
and especially when
they get out of control?

01:47.920 --> 01:48.509
Jinzi,

01:49.680 --> 01:52.940
these things don't really have much
to do with you, do they?

01:52.960 --> 01:53.890
What do you mean?

02:01.210 --> 02:04.350
[Geum Ja shines brightly.]

02:04.790 --> 02:06.850
Don't edit videos like this anymore.

02:07.040 --> 02:07.920
It's not like you to

02:07.920 --> 02:09.509
deliberately crop the group photo

02:09.509 --> 02:11.110
and make it a photo of just us.

02:12.480 --> 02:14.200
Okay, I get it.

02:15.220 --> 02:17.850
I can tell you care a lot about
your landlady.

02:17.880 --> 02:20.590
But I won't give up just like that.

02:21.880 --> 02:23.950
We still have plenty of time.

02:25.670 --> 02:26.320
Goodbye.

02:27.000 --> 02:27.670
Goodbye.

02:48.510 --> 02:49.240
You're back.

02:50.070 --> 02:51.600
Why are you back so soon?

02:51.630 --> 02:54.160
Why not spend more time with
your girlfriend?

02:55.360 --> 02:56.480
What girlfriend?

02:56.940 --> 02:58.150
Don't talk nonsense.

02:58.660 --> 02:59.910
She's just a friend.

03:00.260 --> 03:01.600
She just showed up without saying a word.

03:01.600 --> 03:03.530
I really hate it when this happens.

03:04.550 --> 03:06.490
I was wondering on the elevator,

03:06.800 --> 03:08.480
what did she see in you?

03:08.510 --> 03:09.630
She's so pretty,

03:10.020 --> 03:12.140
and she's also a big influencer.

03:12.320 --> 03:13.650
What does she see in you?

03:13.790 --> 03:17.720
What does she like about someone like you,
who has to share apartments?

03:29.000 --> 03:29.700
Qian Fei.

03:31.250 --> 03:32.250
Tell me the truth.

03:34.450 --> 03:35.930
Are you a little jealous?

03:42.460 --> 03:43.810
Brother Fei.

03:45.510 --> 03:47.410
Why would I be jealous?

04:14.430 --> 04:16.680
Do you know why I asked you to sit here?

04:19.079 --> 04:20.160
No, I don't.

04:22.670 --> 04:26.080
Because I couldn't figure it out
all through dinner.

04:26.790 --> 04:29.480
Why do I care so much about
that big influencer?

04:31.960 --> 04:33.290
So what do you want to do?

04:35.130 --> 04:35.810
Landlady?

04:36.430 --> 04:38.270
What are you doing? Get out!

04:38.430 --> 04:39.230
Before you come in next time,

04:39.230 --> 04:40.630
could you at least knock?

04:41.280 --> 04:42.550
So fierce.

04:43.080 --> 04:43.740
Good night.

04:49.070 --> 04:50.630
I squished your face!

04:51.480 --> 04:52.920
I'm sorry.

04:56.530 --> 04:59.390
I am indeed a little bothered by
your true identity.

05:01.670 --> 05:02.810
What should I do?

05:06.720 --> 05:07.920
As a finance major,

05:08.350 --> 05:10.080
I have to use a table, of course.

05:19.520 --> 05:20.900
Do I like you?

05:24.670 --> 05:26.600
♪ I really miss you ♪

05:26.520 --> 05:28.960
Do you like me?

05:27.240 --> 05:28.360
♪ My heart is pounding fast ♪

05:28.960 --> 05:31.840
♪ Syncing my breath
to a frequency that longs for you ♪

05:30.160 --> 05:31.020
Maybe a little.

05:32.159 --> 05:34.580
No, no. It should be not at all.

05:32.330 --> 05:33.460
♪ I love you so much ♪

05:34.409 --> 05:37.080
♪ The only you in the whole world ♪

05:37.780 --> 05:40.730
♪ Living in my heart ♪

05:39.480 --> 05:42.530
But... you like the food I cook for you.

05:42.409 --> 05:45.850
♪ The stars see through
the tenderness of the night ♪

05:44.790 --> 05:46.320
Let's leave it open for now.

05:46.560 --> 05:49.340
♪ Lighten the streets of the city ♪

05:47.920 --> 05:49.350
Do you have a girlfriend?

05:49.790 --> 05:53.450
♪ The night breeze blows through
every window ♪

05:51.230 --> 05:52.670
I think so.

05:53.600 --> 05:56.780
♪ Watching the two's
little universe secretly ♪

05:57.190 --> 06:00.370
♪ Meeting will flirt with lazy waiting ♪

06:01.080 --> 06:03.990
♪ Love lights the fireworks ♪

06:04.540 --> 06:07.590
♪ I fell in love with you
without permission ♪

06:08.350 --> 06:11.960
♪ I began to doodle on
this romantic cabin ♪

06:11.400 --> 06:12.640
Good night.

06:13.690 --> 06:15.640
♪ I really miss you ♪

06:16.550 --> 06:17.390
♪ My heart is pounding fast ♪

06:18.120 --> 06:20.850
♪ Syncing my breath
to a frequency that longs for you ♪

06:21.670 --> 06:22.870
♪ I love you so much ♪

06:23.480 --> 06:26.340
♪ The only you in the whole world ♪

06:28.690 --> 06:34.190
♪ Living in my heart ♪

06:42.190 --> 06:43.700
She was jealous just now.

06:44.600 --> 06:46.110
She was jealous over you.

06:47.080 --> 06:49.210
Then why did she suddenly get jealous?

06:49.480 --> 06:50.140
Because...

06:51.430 --> 06:53.790
She has started to fall for you.

06:56.190 --> 06:57.320
That's a bit cheesy.

07:01.640 --> 07:03.040
She was jealous just now.

07:04.110 --> 07:05.310
She was jealous over you.

07:05.310 --> 07:06.910
Then why did she get jealous?

07:07.840 --> 07:08.500
Because...

07:09.710 --> 07:12.390
She has started to fall for you.

07:19.180 --> 07:20.650
[Inpatient Department]

07:19.640 --> 07:21.850
Mom, you look really good now.

07:22.550 --> 07:23.950
You are recovering well.

07:24.400 --> 07:26.090
It's all thanks to your dad.

07:26.400 --> 07:27.600
If it weren't for him,

07:27.870 --> 07:30.470
I might not have made it this time.

07:32.350 --> 07:33.870
In life,

07:34.190 --> 07:37.720
no matter how much money you make
or how high a position you hold,

07:37.760 --> 07:40.890
nothing compares to having
a caring person by your side.

07:44.550 --> 07:45.340
Hai,

07:45.580 --> 07:47.060
tell Mom seriously,

07:47.400 --> 07:49.350
why did you break up with Fei?

07:54.840 --> 07:55.880
Our...

07:57.670 --> 07:59.080
personalities are not quite compatible.

07:59.080 --> 08:02.110
It hasn't been easy to maintain
such a long relationship.

08:02.110 --> 08:04.560
Fei is a very good girl,

08:04.840 --> 08:06.690
and she is sincere to you.

08:07.350 --> 08:08.390
If you miss her,

08:08.520 --> 08:11.240
where else will you find such a good girl?

08:14.640 --> 08:15.680
All right, Mom.

08:16.350 --> 08:17.950
Don't worry about this.

08:18.430 --> 08:21.760
Now that you are sick,
you should focus on rest and recovery.

08:24.450 --> 08:26.450
Go and win Fei back.

08:27.880 --> 08:29.830
Fei is a kind girl.

08:30.830 --> 08:33.830
She'll definitely remember
the good things about you

08:34.520 --> 08:36.230
Just apologize properly,

08:36.789 --> 08:38.240
or beg her.

08:38.710 --> 08:39.600
Maybe

08:39.880 --> 08:41.539
she will just change her mind.

08:45.120 --> 08:47.120
We have been broken up for a long time.

08:47.120 --> 08:48.450
I just haven't told you.

08:50.120 --> 08:52.320
I was the one who brought up the breakup.

08:53.280 --> 08:54.480
She won't forgive me.

08:57.160 --> 08:58.340
You.

08:58.950 --> 09:00.840
I don't know what to say about you.

09:22.750 --> 09:23.520
Dad.

09:23.640 --> 09:25.180
Hello, Fei.

09:25.790 --> 09:27.670
I just heard from Aunt He.

09:28.050 --> 09:30.890
That Yuan Feng is really a piece of work.

09:31.130 --> 09:33.640
Fortunately, he showed his true colors
on the first meeting.

09:33.640 --> 09:34.780
I told you so.

09:34.800 --> 09:36.820
Stop worrying about this in the future.

09:36.820 --> 09:38.020
I know what I'm doing.

09:39.000 --> 09:41.000
I was indeed worried for nothing.

09:42.120 --> 09:44.370
But Yuan Feng went home and said

09:44.590 --> 09:46.280
when you guys met,

09:46.290 --> 09:48.190
[Dad]

09:46.550 --> 09:48.240
you brought a boy with you.

09:48.360 --> 09:49.150
Is that true?

09:52.170 --> 09:54.040
Yes, that did happen.

09:54.160 --> 09:55.120
So is that boy

09:55.880 --> 09:57.300
your boyfriend?

09:57.830 --> 09:58.670
Well,

09:59.110 --> 10:01.040
how should I put it?

10:01.070 --> 10:01.980
Well...

10:03.440 --> 10:04.150
He...

10:05.880 --> 10:08.240
If you have a guy you like,

10:08.400 --> 10:09.930
I won't have to worry so much

10:09.950 --> 10:12.430
and arrange blind dates for you
for nothing.

10:12.760 --> 10:15.160
Just get along well with him.

10:17.520 --> 10:18.190
Yes.

10:18.240 --> 10:20.560
I... I didn't tell you before

10:20.590 --> 10:23.830
because I just met him.

10:24.240 --> 10:26.100
We don't know each other well yet.

10:26.160 --> 10:28.220
I still need some time to observe him.

10:29.000 --> 10:30.950
So how is the observation going?

10:32.160 --> 10:33.190
Just so-so.

10:33.430 --> 10:35.160
What do you mean, 'just so-so'?

10:35.590 --> 10:38.120
Where is he from? What does he do?

10:39.000 --> 10:40.280
What is his personality like?

10:40.280 --> 10:41.940
How is his family background?

10:42.760 --> 10:45.860
Baby, let me heat up
a glass of milk for you.

10:49.160 --> 10:51.200
Fei, is that him?

10:51.310 --> 10:51.880
Fei?

10:52.950 --> 10:53.590
Fei?

10:53.920 --> 10:54.750
Dad.

10:54.950 --> 10:55.550
Okay.

10:56.640 --> 10:58.180
I'll go heat it up for you right now.

10:58.180 --> 11:00.510
Make sure to drink it while it's hot.
Mwah.

11:03.240 --> 11:04.480
His surname is Li,

11:04.790 --> 11:06.920
and he works in the same industry as me.

11:09.200 --> 11:11.230
Well, he's a little younger than me.

11:11.520 --> 11:13.530
He has some character flaws,

11:13.590 --> 11:14.760
but it's not a big deal.

11:14.760 --> 11:16.890
With a little training, he'll be fine.

11:17.760 --> 11:20.200
And, well, he doesn't own a house.

11:20.790 --> 11:21.880
He had a falling out with his dad

11:21.880 --> 11:22.940
and got kicked out.

11:23.040 --> 11:25.040
Now he's looking for a place to rent.

11:27.190 --> 11:29.130
Look, you two are already so close.

11:29.160 --> 11:30.430
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

11:30.430 --> 11:32.360
Things wouldn't have come to this.

11:34.160 --> 11:34.940
Fei.

11:34.970 --> 11:38.400
I remember the guy
who rented your place before

11:38.430 --> 11:39.710
also had the surname Li.

11:39.710 --> 11:41.840
I think he was in the same industry too.

11:41.950 --> 11:44.260
You remembered it wrong, Dad.

11:44.360 --> 11:45.890
He... his surname is Huang.

11:47.710 --> 11:50.400
Huang? I seem to remember you

11:50.490 --> 11:52.090
mentioning a Li something,

11:52.120 --> 11:54.920
saying he was lazy
and wouldn't take out the trash.

11:55.240 --> 11:56.380
Did I really remember wrongly?

11:56.380 --> 11:58.500
You have a bad memory.

11:58.590 --> 12:00.760
I will send you and Aunt He

12:00.790 --> 12:02.850
some fish oil to improve your memory.

12:02.950 --> 12:03.840
I have to go.

12:04.090 --> 12:05.520
I'm doing housework.

12:05.650 --> 12:06.620
Okay.

12:12.060 --> 12:13.430
I saved you once.

12:13.950 --> 12:15.680
Performance fee please, muah.

12:15.790 --> 12:17.360
You are something.

12:17.390 --> 12:20.160
You just forced your way
into my family's drama.

12:21.280 --> 12:22.540
I'm helping you, okay?

12:22.640 --> 12:23.900
Did I ask for your help?

12:24.070 --> 12:25.640
Move out right now. You're so annoying.

12:25.640 --> 12:26.740
I won't.

12:27.550 --> 12:29.430
If your dad finds out
your new boyfriend is gone,

12:29.430 --> 12:31.090
how will you explain it to him?

12:31.240 --> 12:32.360
You have to see it through to the end.

12:32.360 --> 12:34.360
Show some sense of responsibility.

12:36.430 --> 12:37.760
Look. Your dad is calling again.

12:37.760 --> 12:39.850
-Stop talking.
-At this point, I should step in

12:39.850 --> 12:40.880
and save you. Come on, give it to me.

12:40.880 --> 12:41.540
Wait, wait.

12:43.290 --> 12:44.870
[Wang Ruohai]

12:50.350 --> 12:51.700
Hello? Yes?

12:53.040 --> 12:53.810
Qian Fei.

12:56.590 --> 12:59.650
My mom recently transferred to
a hospital in Shanghai.

12:59.830 --> 13:01.490
Auntie has been transferred?

13:01.530 --> 13:03.260
Did her illness get worse?

13:03.310 --> 13:04.210
No, no.

13:04.890 --> 13:07.550
She finished her surgery and
came to Shanghai for rehabilitation.

13:07.550 --> 13:09.880
She's been talking about you a lot lately.

13:09.950 --> 13:11.920
I was wondering if you have time
to come see her.

13:11.920 --> 13:12.610
Sure.

13:12.760 --> 13:13.510
Just send me

13:13.530 --> 13:16.010
the hospital's address and room number.

13:16.040 --> 13:17.370
I'll go when I have time.

13:17.790 --> 13:18.790
Okay.

13:19.370 --> 13:20.230
That's it then.

13:20.430 --> 13:21.000
Yes.

13:21.790 --> 13:22.560
Bye.

13:32.100 --> 13:34.790
What are you thinking about?
You look so glum.

13:35.710 --> 13:38.510
If you don't want to go,
you shouldn't have agreed.

13:38.550 --> 13:39.950
You're overthinking it.

13:40.110 --> 13:42.160
His parents took good care of me

13:42.320 --> 13:43.560
and treated me well.

13:43.680 --> 13:44.520
I should go.

13:45.960 --> 13:46.630
Whatever.

13:47.870 --> 13:49.040
I was just thinking,

13:50.280 --> 13:52.590
since she transferred to
a hospital in Shanghai,

13:52.590 --> 13:54.480
they must need a lot of money.

13:55.160 --> 13:57.210
But the money I owe Wang Ruohai,

13:57.270 --> 13:59.200
I haven't finished paying it off yet.

13:59.200 --> 14:00.200
How much is left?

14:01.310 --> 14:04.330
With odd jobs and overtime,

14:04.390 --> 14:05.990
I've paid back 130,000 yuan.

14:06.280 --> 14:08.180
There's 370,000 yuan left.

14:09.190 --> 14:11.120
Although Wang Ruohai isn't rushing me,

14:11.120 --> 14:12.850
I still want to pay it back
as soon as possible,

14:12.850 --> 14:14.890
so as not to delay Auntie's treatment.

14:14.890 --> 14:16.580
That's not a small amount.

14:16.890 --> 14:17.890
Actually,

14:18.090 --> 14:21.110
I previously helped
a senior from our school translate

14:21.110 --> 14:23.310
300,000 words of hedge fund materials.

14:23.670 --> 14:24.870
It pays 100,000 yuan.

14:25.270 --> 14:26.440
If he could pay me,

14:26.470 --> 14:28.470
I could give it directly to Wang Ruohai.

14:28.470 --> 14:29.960
Anyway, as for Wang Ruohai,

14:29.960 --> 14:31.290
I won't give my opinion.

14:31.730 --> 14:32.800
I have a bad temper.

14:32.830 --> 14:34.230
Whenever I think of him, my hands itch.

14:34.230 --> 14:35.760
But as for your senior,

14:35.990 --> 14:37.710
I don't think you need to worry
about being polite.

14:37.710 --> 14:38.910
Ask for it right away.

14:40.650 --> 14:42.910
It's only right to get paid for your work.

14:45.530 --> 14:46.800
[Senior]

14:51.040 --> 14:54.130
[Senior, when can you pay me
the manuscript fee?]

14:56.000 --> 14:57.800
Why did he block me?

14:58.120 --> 14:59.250
Blocked you?

15:00.260 --> 15:01.170
Do you have his phone number?

15:01.170 --> 15:02.230
Call him directly.

15:07.160 --> 15:08.090
[Senior Yuan Qin]

15:16.920 --> 15:18.130
No, he didn't answer.

15:18.830 --> 15:20.040
What's going on?

15:20.040 --> 15:21.680
It's okay. Don't panic.

15:22.650 --> 15:24.540
Find his friends, family,

15:25.070 --> 15:26.430
colleagues, or boss.

15:26.550 --> 15:28.880
We'll definitely dig this scoundrel out.

15:30.190 --> 15:30.720
Okay.

15:34.490 --> 15:35.920
[BM Building]

15:43.650 --> 15:44.360
Hello, Miss.

15:44.360 --> 15:45.720
How can I help you?

15:45.830 --> 15:47.520
I want to see Director Yuan Qin.

15:47.520 --> 15:48.870
Do you have an appointment?

15:48.870 --> 15:49.600
No.

15:49.670 --> 15:50.760
If you don't have an appointment yet,

15:50.760 --> 15:51.910
I can make one for you.

15:51.910 --> 15:53.250
You just need to tell him

15:53.430 --> 15:54.740
that one of his important clients is here,

15:54.740 --> 15:55.520
and he will come out.

15:55.520 --> 15:56.430
Okay. Please wait a moment.

15:56.430 --> 15:57.200
Thank you.

16:00.120 --> 16:02.190
Hello, I'm looking for Director Yuan.

16:02.190 --> 16:04.790
Yes, there's a lady at the door
looking for him.

16:13.920 --> 16:14.920
Where is the client?

16:14.920 --> 16:16.130
That lady over there.

16:19.380 --> 16:21.860
Yuan Qin, you can't hide from me forever.

16:22.670 --> 16:24.470
I'll leave once this is settled.

16:25.430 --> 16:26.560
Let's talk outside.

16:35.710 --> 16:37.360
It's not that I don't want to pay you,

16:37.360 --> 16:39.890
but the quality of your draft
was really poor.

16:40.040 --> 16:41.430
I had to find someone to retranslate it,

16:41.430 --> 16:43.090
which delayed the submission

16:43.310 --> 16:45.160
and almost ruined the client's business.

16:45.160 --> 16:46.310
I haven't even told you about it.

16:46.310 --> 16:47.090
Is that so?

16:47.770 --> 16:48.710
If that's the case,

16:48.710 --> 16:50.430
send me the re-translated draft.

16:50.430 --> 16:51.690
I want to learn from it.

16:52.430 --> 16:53.360
What do you mean?

16:53.670 --> 16:55.330
You clearly don't believe me.

16:55.430 --> 16:57.160
Does it look like I can't afford to
pay for your fees?

16:57.160 --> 16:59.320
You owe me 100,000 yuan
for the translation.

16:59.320 --> 17:00.920
You didn't say before that
if it's not adopted,

17:00.920 --> 17:01.840
you wouldn't pay.

17:01.840 --> 17:03.190
I've already put in the work.

17:03.190 --> 17:05.400
Qian Fei, what's wrong with you?

17:05.430 --> 17:07.270
You caused us a loss this time.

17:07.359 --> 17:08.470
The fact that I didn't ask you
for compensation

17:08.470 --> 17:10.319
is already a goodwill gesture
as an alumni.

17:10.319 --> 17:11.599
Do whatever you want. I'm busy.

17:11.599 --> 17:12.530
You can't leave.

17:13.560 --> 17:14.190
You either

17:14.400 --> 17:16.390
send me the re-translated draft.

17:16.560 --> 17:18.270
If I think I didn't do a good job,

17:18.270 --> 17:19.730
I'll give up on my payment.

17:20.160 --> 17:21.839
Otherwise, pay me for my work.

17:23.270 --> 17:24.119
You go back first.

17:24.119 --> 17:24.950
I'll send it to you later.

17:24.950 --> 17:25.839
Send it now.

17:32.470 --> 17:33.930
You're really something.

17:34.950 --> 17:37.750
How come I didn't realize
you were so tough before?

17:40.940 --> 17:43.110
[Senior Yuan Qin]

17:41.920 --> 17:43.250
I sent it to your WeChat.

17:43.430 --> 17:45.470
Wait, why is it only 10,000 yuan?

17:45.750 --> 17:48.160
That's all there is.
Take the money and leave.

17:48.160 --> 17:50.360
I'll only leave when you pay up the rest.

17:57.880 --> 18:00.280
No wonder Wang Ruohai
dumped you back then.

18:00.360 --> 18:01.950
A woman who loves money this much,

18:01.950 --> 18:03.010
who would want you?

18:04.900 --> 18:07.290
Money is so much more enduring

18:07.320 --> 18:08.750
than my relationship with Wang Ruohai.

18:08.750 --> 18:10.950
And it's also more reliable than
our relationship as alumni, isn't it?

18:10.950 --> 18:13.120
I'm not like you, Yuan Qin.

18:13.270 --> 18:15.790
I've always earned my money
fair and square.

18:21.360 --> 18:21.800
Hello?

18:27.030 --> 18:28.780
No, it's not like that.

18:29.050 --> 18:30.220
Let me explain.

18:30.920 --> 18:32.710
No, I... let me explain.

18:37.800 --> 18:38.490
Qian Fei,

18:39.120 --> 18:39.990
what kind of secret relationship

18:39.990 --> 18:41.690
do you have with our chairman?

18:43.030 --> 18:44.430
Don't play dirty tricks on me
if you have the guts.

18:44.430 --> 18:45.800
What are you talking about?

18:45.800 --> 18:46.890
Watch your mouth.

18:46.920 --> 18:48.030
Miss Qian Fei, right?

18:48.030 --> 18:49.490
I will handle your matter.

18:49.710 --> 18:50.710
Please follow me.

18:53.320 --> 18:53.970
Qian Fei.

18:54.230 --> 18:55.190
Don't go, Qian Fei!

18:55.190 --> 18:55.880
Sir!

18:55.880 --> 18:56.750
Qian Fei, explain this to me!

18:56.750 --> 18:57.470
I am very sorry.

18:57.470 --> 18:59.750
Our former employee Yuan Qin

18:59.750 --> 19:01.430
had such an unpleasant incident with you

19:01.430 --> 19:03.550
over compensation.

19:03.770 --> 19:04.840
However, I have checked.

19:04.840 --> 19:06.400
The company indeed should have
paid you the service fee

19:06.400 --> 19:07.430
according to the contract.

19:07.430 --> 19:09.360
I'll take you to the finance department
to settle it now.

19:09.360 --> 19:10.360
Former employee?

19:11.030 --> 19:11.830
That's right.

19:11.880 --> 19:14.430
Our chairman was very angry
when he learned about this.

19:14.430 --> 19:16.560
In order to maintain
the company's reputation and discipline,

19:16.560 --> 19:17.820
he has been dismissed.

19:18.400 --> 19:19.660
Come, this way please.

19:42.190 --> 19:43.190
Good morning.

19:43.920 --> 19:44.670
What's up?

19:45.470 --> 19:47.990
Just wanted to walk with you as a friend.

19:48.490 --> 19:51.290
Don't. It will cause misunderstandings.

19:51.770 --> 19:52.560
I need to go to work.

19:52.560 --> 19:54.160
Let's mind our own business.

19:54.670 --> 19:55.430
Yu.

19:55.690 --> 19:57.740
What's up?
You're looking for a fight again?

19:57.740 --> 19:59.260
Can I take two minutes

19:59.640 --> 20:00.920
of your time

20:01.310 --> 20:02.310
to say a few words?

20:06.230 --> 20:06.750
Yes,

20:07.640 --> 20:09.500
I used to be a good boy

20:09.600 --> 20:11.340
who only listened to his mom.

20:11.990 --> 20:13.800
But ever since I started working,

20:13.800 --> 20:15.550
I've become a man.

20:15.920 --> 20:17.700
I never thought my job

20:18.160 --> 20:20.760
was an iron bowl that
my parents could be proud of.

20:20.760 --> 20:22.270
And I don't think being a local

20:22.270 --> 20:23.960
makes me superior.

20:24.600 --> 20:27.220
Just like all the young people
in Shanghai,

20:27.600 --> 20:30.060
I just want to find my worth here,

20:30.190 --> 20:33.120
and do something real for
the community and society.

20:35.120 --> 20:36.880
Even if every day is ordinary,

20:37.360 --> 20:38.890
I still find it meaningful.

20:40.950 --> 20:41.660
Okay.

20:42.190 --> 20:44.790
Then I'm very honored to
have a friend like you,

20:44.920 --> 20:47.580
who is rooted in the grassroots
and is selfless.

20:49.120 --> 20:50.950
It’s just that I’m used to messing around.

20:50.950 --> 20:52.800
Our lifestyles are different,

20:52.920 --> 20:54.640
and we wouldn't have any common ground.

20:54.640 --> 20:56.670
You've done so many part-time jobs,
of course you'd know.

20:56.670 --> 20:57.880
Having common ground

20:57.990 --> 20:59.500
has nothing to do with
being in the same circle

20:59.500 --> 21:01.470
or doing the same job.

21:04.510 --> 21:06.040
Seeing you so busy every day

21:06.470 --> 21:08.000
and loving your job so much,

21:08.640 --> 21:10.050
I'm very happy for you

21:10.270 --> 21:11.490
and I admire you.

21:13.750 --> 21:14.920
But to be honest,

21:15.160 --> 21:16.220
I don't long for it.

21:17.600 --> 21:19.080
Because the life I'm living now

21:19.080 --> 21:20.400
is also the life I love.

21:20.600 --> 21:22.900
Not because of my mom or anyone else,

21:23.510 --> 21:24.970
but only because I like it.

21:26.120 --> 21:26.990
Of course.

21:27.470 --> 21:28.870
Staying true to yourself

21:29.030 --> 21:30.290
takes a lot of courage.

21:30.510 --> 21:31.430
This about you,

21:33.190 --> 21:34.600
I've always liked.

21:35.670 --> 21:36.700
Anyway,

21:37.160 --> 21:39.120
if you ever feel tired one day

21:39.270 --> 21:40.600
and want to take a break,

21:42.320 --> 21:43.850
I will always be behind you,

21:44.270 --> 21:46.320
even if just as a normal friend.

22:08.440 --> 22:10.310
[Inpatient Department]

22:09.670 --> 22:11.400
Auntie, you must have faith.

22:11.560 --> 22:13.160
This is the best hospital in Shanghai.

22:13.160 --> 22:14.800
As long as you cooperate with the doctors,

22:14.800 --> 22:16.460
you will definitely recover.

22:17.360 --> 22:18.760
I know, Fei.

22:20.640 --> 22:21.400
Fei,

22:22.190 --> 22:23.470
I just want to ask you,

22:24.240 --> 22:25.890
did Hai do something

22:25.920 --> 22:27.160
to upset you?

22:27.710 --> 22:29.560
Do you really have to break up?

22:33.710 --> 22:34.500
We...

22:35.670 --> 22:38.000
just aren't right for each other anymore.

22:38.710 --> 22:41.920
I know Hai initiated the breakup.

22:42.470 --> 22:44.690
But you've been together for
so many years.

22:44.690 --> 22:46.670
Now that things are getting better,

22:46.670 --> 22:48.510
why can't you stay together?

22:50.560 --> 22:53.220
I know it's all Hai's fault.

22:53.950 --> 22:55.750
I apologize to you on his behalf.

22:55.990 --> 22:57.620
Can you forgive him

22:57.890 --> 22:59.610
and give him another chance?

23:03.190 --> 23:05.240
Auntie, please don't say that.

23:07.700 --> 23:08.670
He and I...

23:10.120 --> 23:12.120
can't go back to the way things were.

23:23.360 --> 23:25.020
When it comes to your matters,

23:25.600 --> 23:27.370
I know I can't force things.

23:28.190 --> 23:28.930
But I...

23:30.330 --> 23:31.860
just can't bear to lose you.

23:32.230 --> 23:33.420
Auntie.

23:34.150 --> 23:35.480
Focus on your recovery

23:35.510 --> 23:37.730
and don't think about anything else.

23:38.950 --> 23:41.650
Your body can only get better
when you have a positive mindset.

23:41.650 --> 23:42.880
Just get some good rest,

23:42.880 --> 23:43.950
cooperate with the doctors,

23:43.950 --> 23:45.600
and I'll find chances to
come see you in the future.

23:45.600 --> 23:46.590
Okay?

23:49.160 --> 23:49.670
Okay.

23:50.230 --> 23:51.160
Want some water?

23:51.990 --> 23:52.360
Here.

23:56.660 --> 23:59.150
You don't have to see me off.
Go back inside and stay with Auntie.

23:59.150 --> 24:00.060
Qian Fei.

23:59.230 --> 24:01.110
[Nurse Station]

24:03.950 --> 24:05.350
Thank you for helping me.

24:06.190 --> 24:07.190
I wasn't helping you.

24:07.190 --> 24:10.190
It's because Auntie has been
so nice to me all these years.

24:10.190 --> 24:11.450
I just feel bad for her.

24:13.600 --> 24:14.990
I've always owed you an apology.

24:14.990 --> 24:15.990
Stop right there.

24:16.570 --> 24:18.150
If this apology

24:18.400 --> 24:19.690
is about our breakup,

24:19.920 --> 24:21.250
there's really no need.

24:21.320 --> 24:22.780
I don't need your apology.

24:23.030 --> 24:24.600
If your apology

24:24.980 --> 24:27.040
is for the garage video you uploaded,

24:27.400 --> 24:28.330
then I think

24:28.920 --> 24:31.120
you should save it for your girlfriend.

24:34.120 --> 24:35.880
Stop with the nonsense.

24:35.900 --> 24:38.710
Taking good care of Auntie is
more important than anything else.

24:38.710 --> 24:39.520
Oh, right.

24:40.220 --> 24:42.120
I transferred another 100,000 yuan
to your account.

24:42.120 --> 24:43.060
As for the rest,

24:43.190 --> 24:44.990
I will pay you back as soon as possible.

24:44.990 --> 24:46.470
Qian Fei, don't be like this.

24:46.470 --> 24:47.100
I know this...

24:47.100 --> 24:47.830
I'm leaving.

25:05.340 --> 25:06.340
Definitely.

25:22.990 --> 25:25.120
Let's see how long you can keep this up.

25:25.470 --> 25:26.120
What is it?

25:26.190 --> 25:27.480
Think you look cool?

25:29.240 --> 25:30.280
What?

25:34.920 --> 25:36.950
When I signed the papers
and received the money today,

25:36.950 --> 25:38.070
I found it strange.

25:38.190 --> 25:40.760
You asked me in such detail last night

25:40.840 --> 25:42.430
about which company Yuan Qin works for

25:42.430 --> 25:43.830
and what his position is.

25:44.570 --> 25:45.540
What did you do?

25:45.640 --> 25:46.400
Gosh.

25:47.430 --> 25:49.760
I can't believe you guessed it so quickly.

25:53.080 --> 25:55.400
Even though Yuan Qin is ruthless,

25:55.560 --> 25:58.010
him losing his job because of me,

25:58.950 --> 26:00.750
isn't that a bit too much?

26:02.010 --> 26:04.120
I really can't listen to this anymore.

26:04.120 --> 26:05.560
Do you think the world,

26:05.700 --> 26:07.010
without your kindness,

26:07.010 --> 26:08.710
would stop turning?

26:09.190 --> 26:10.090
Qian Fei,

26:10.230 --> 26:13.150
can you have some backbone and character?

26:15.050 --> 26:16.080
Stop radiating your

26:16.080 --> 26:18.080
misplaced kindness, okay?

26:18.320 --> 26:19.240
You're right.

26:19.400 --> 26:21.060
I really should grow a temper.

26:23.800 --> 26:25.070
But,

26:25.710 --> 26:28.050
I was so great today

26:28.080 --> 26:29.940
and made such a big contribution,

26:30.120 --> 26:33.770
so I believe I definitely won't be
washing the dishes tonight.

26:34.990 --> 26:37.390
Of course you don't have to
wash the dishes.

26:38.960 --> 26:40.230
But go prepare the ingredients for me.

26:40.230 --> 26:42.760
Don't even think about
freeloading anymore.

26:43.040 --> 26:45.030
I told you to grow a temper,
and you did it pretty fast.

26:45.030 --> 26:46.560
And you're using it at home!

26:47.400 --> 26:48.150
You...

26:48.270 --> 26:50.470
You're just a bully at home, that's all.

26:52.800 --> 26:54.800
What ingredients should I prepare?

26:55.400 --> 26:56.190
How much should I prepare?

26:56.190 --> 26:58.050
Shrimp meat and pig heart.

26:58.640 --> 27:00.500
To kill the body and the soul?

27:00.600 --> 27:02.230
[Shanghai Kangde Hospital]

27:02.360 --> 27:04.990
[Inpatient Department]

27:16.800 --> 27:17.600
Get in the car.

27:32.230 --> 27:33.500
Why didn't you tell me

27:33.710 --> 27:35.600
that Qian Fei was also coming
to the hospital today?

27:35.600 --> 27:36.880
Why didn't you tell your parents

27:36.880 --> 27:38.540
that we are already together?

27:38.710 --> 27:40.230
Do you know how awkward it was for me

27:40.230 --> 27:41.490
to face all this today?

27:45.270 --> 27:47.120
On the first day my parents arrived
in Shanghai,

27:47.120 --> 27:48.260
I called to ask you

27:48.400 --> 27:50.060
if you wanted to come see them.

27:52.470 --> 27:53.870
I wanted you to meet my mom

27:53.920 --> 27:55.050
to tell her

27:55.750 --> 27:57.190
about our relationship.

27:57.840 --> 27:59.170
Maybe you were too busy.

28:01.140 --> 28:03.800
With so many things happening at
Shanlifang recently,

28:03.800 --> 28:05.210
how could I not be busy?

28:06.270 --> 28:08.530
Your matters are always more important.

28:08.800 --> 28:09.230
What?

28:10.270 --> 28:11.710
The two questions I just asked,

28:11.710 --> 28:12.910
you couldn't answer,

28:13.270 --> 28:15.160
and now you think it's my fault?

28:20.800 --> 28:22.030
I didn't tell my mom

28:22.990 --> 28:25.690
because I wasn't sure
when you were coming,

28:26.190 --> 28:27.590
so I didn't say anything.

28:28.120 --> 28:30.050
I have to consider her feelings.

28:31.120 --> 28:32.650
As for Qian Fei and my mom,

28:32.920 --> 28:34.720
they've always been very close.

28:35.120 --> 28:36.780
Qian Fei was just being polite

28:36.840 --> 28:38.100
by coming to visit her.

28:41.120 --> 28:42.980
You have such a reasonable excuse

28:43.160 --> 28:45.290
that I'm almost embarrassed to be mad.

28:47.510 --> 28:49.170
Thank you for understanding.

28:51.950 --> 28:52.600
Get out.

29:11.760 --> 29:14.770
[Inpatient Department]

29:31.560 --> 29:34.040
Mr. Liao, you are in a good mood.

29:35.710 --> 29:36.410
Mr. Sang.

29:41.400 --> 29:43.400
Hello, Mr. Liao. I am Ma Li.

29:43.600 --> 29:44.250
I know.

29:47.030 --> 29:48.230
Young and promising.

29:49.120 --> 29:50.800
I heard from Mr. Sang

29:50.950 --> 29:53.320
that you want to know more about
our Fulaxida.

29:53.320 --> 29:56.040
Look, Mr. Ma gets straight to the point.

29:57.990 --> 29:59.190
To be precise,

29:59.360 --> 30:02.090
my interest doesn't lie in
any specific company

30:02.670 --> 30:03.500
or industry,

30:04.080 --> 30:07.190
but in capable young people like you.

30:08.750 --> 30:10.950
Do you remember the Venture Capital Forum?

30:10.950 --> 30:13.270
When you were speaking passionately
on stage,

30:13.270 --> 30:15.000
I was actually in the audience.

30:16.120 --> 30:18.570
From passion to profession,

30:18.800 --> 30:20.140
from policy to business,

30:20.140 --> 30:21.600
and from ideal to reality.

30:21.710 --> 30:24.680
You had already caught my eye back then.

30:25.080 --> 30:27.210
What's important is that in many ways,

30:27.400 --> 30:29.260
you were just like I was back then.

30:30.030 --> 30:31.430
You flatter me, Mr. Liao.

30:31.920 --> 30:34.030
I mainly wanted to ask, then...

30:34.230 --> 30:34.880
I know.

30:35.640 --> 30:36.570
You want to ask me

30:36.600 --> 30:39.360
why it took until today,
until this very moment,

30:39.990 --> 30:41.650
for me to meet with you, right?

30:42.740 --> 30:43.740
As you all know,

30:44.320 --> 30:46.130
recently, our Shanlifang Group

30:46.160 --> 30:47.710
has been busy with its IPO.

30:47.880 --> 30:49.800
I have to personally oversee

30:49.840 --> 30:51.360
all the affairs of this company,

30:51.360 --> 30:53.230
so I didn't have time for you.

30:53.990 --> 30:54.550
Well,

30:55.400 --> 30:57.360
I met with Mr. Sang a few days ago,

30:57.560 --> 30:58.890
and we talked about you.

30:58.920 --> 30:59.850
We were thinking

30:59.880 --> 31:01.610
about how we could help you out.

31:01.670 --> 31:02.270
Well,

31:02.730 --> 31:04.160
while I was practicing just now,

31:04.160 --> 31:06.330
I hit a bunker shot,

31:06.360 --> 31:07.820
and suddenly I had an idea.

31:09.320 --> 31:12.080
Chairman Liao, I am not quite getting it.

31:13.230 --> 31:15.750
Mr. Liao, I don't know if I'm right.

31:15.880 --> 31:17.760
You are now comparing Shanlifang

31:17.880 --> 31:19.810
to the sand

31:19.840 --> 31:21.170
surrounding this ball.

31:21.900 --> 31:23.560
And comparing Mr. Ma's Fulaxida

31:23.560 --> 31:26.930
to the ball resting on
the surface of this sand.

31:27.190 --> 31:27.800
Right?

31:28.920 --> 31:29.880
Exactly.

31:30.600 --> 31:31.660
Come here, you two.

31:37.940 --> 31:41.130
If Fulaxida wants to
go public and cash out,

31:41.160 --> 31:43.820
it's like this ball
being successfully hit.

31:45.080 --> 31:46.480
But it's very difficult.

31:46.950 --> 31:48.430
If I were to swing,

31:48.800 --> 31:51.950
I would aim for the sand behind the ball,

31:52.250 --> 31:54.120
which represents our Shanlifang Group.

31:54.120 --> 31:57.230
This way, the ball will be
brought out smoothly.

31:57.880 --> 31:58.330
See?

32:02.510 --> 32:07.390
By doing so, we can achieve
an indirect and rapid IPO to cash out.

32:08.640 --> 32:09.570
Young man,

32:09.670 --> 32:12.600
do you want to hit this bunker shot?

32:16.080 --> 32:18.740
Chairman Liao, I'm not very good at golf,

32:19.030 --> 32:20.830
and I don't know the secret to it.

32:24.920 --> 32:27.160
I just do whatever comes to mind.

32:27.800 --> 32:28.400
No rush.

32:29.800 --> 32:31.530
Think about it. Ponder it over.

32:31.800 --> 32:34.510
If you want to take this shot,
find me anytime.

32:34.990 --> 32:36.400
Thank you, Chairman Liao.

32:36.400 --> 32:38.470
By the way, I invited you two here today

32:38.470 --> 32:39.800
as I wanted you to taste

32:39.800 --> 32:41.220
some homemade red wine.

32:44.670 --> 32:46.670
The grape harvest is good this year.

32:47.270 --> 32:48.000
Here.

32:53.540 --> 32:55.900
[Financial Analysis of the Group]

33:12.330 --> 33:13.770
[Another case of irregular conduct
at Shanlifang Hotel]

33:13.800 --> 33:15.290
[Bedding in guest rooms is not changed
after each guest]

33:19.400 --> 33:20.640
Oh my god.

33:24.990 --> 33:26.190
We're doomed!

33:26.190 --> 33:26.800
I'm telling you,

33:26.800 --> 33:29.200
Shanlifang is really in trouble this time!

33:29.600 --> 33:31.430
I'm showering. Why are you knocking?

33:31.430 --> 33:32.160
I'm telling you.

33:32.160 --> 33:34.640
Shanlifang Hotel has been exposed for
irregular conduct again.

33:34.640 --> 33:36.990
The bedding wasn't changed
after each guest.

33:36.990 --> 33:37.880
We're doomed.

33:37.920 --> 33:40.190
I knew it wasn't that simple last time!

33:40.270 --> 33:41.350
I can't hear you.

33:41.880 --> 33:43.290
Come out first!

33:43.320 --> 33:44.580
We're doomed. Really!

33:44.640 --> 33:45.360
I'm telling you,

33:45.360 --> 33:46.670
the conservative PR campaign previously

33:46.670 --> 33:47.710
is now useless.

33:47.750 --> 33:50.080
Even if they apologize or admit it now,

33:50.120 --> 33:51.840
it's too late. You hear me?

33:51.950 --> 33:54.100
Can you wait until I finish showering?

33:54.430 --> 33:55.720
Oh my god.

33:55.760 --> 33:57.860
The comments section is blowing up!

33:57.920 --> 34:00.190
There are thousands of comments.

34:00.360 --> 34:02.150
These sanitary conditions
are really concerning.

34:02.150 --> 34:03.350
Are you done nagging?

34:17.840 --> 34:18.650
[Items in the hotel rooms
could have been used repeatedly]

34:18.670 --> 34:19.880
[It is unclear if items were replaced
after every guest]

34:33.210 --> 34:34.080
[Items in the hotel rooms
could have been used repeatedly]

34:34.100 --> 34:35.100
[It is unclear if items were replaced
after every guest]

34:45.739 --> 34:47.179
[Dai Xi]

34:47.900 --> 34:48.760
Hello, Dai Xi?

34:50.840 --> 34:52.909
A meeting right now?

34:54.429 --> 34:55.239
Okay.

35:21.720 --> 35:22.710
Well...

35:23.190 --> 35:24.430
Did you also get the notice

35:24.430 --> 35:26.290
to attend a last-minute meeting?

35:29.030 --> 35:29.800
I figured.

35:29.840 --> 35:31.600
Since such a big incident happened, right?

35:31.600 --> 35:34.530
Tonight is definitely going
to be a sleepless night.

35:34.680 --> 35:36.840
We definitely have to help the client
solve their problems.

35:36.840 --> 35:37.900
We're on call 24/7.

35:41.590 --> 35:44.590
-Well, just now…
-I didn’t see anything.

35:46.280 --> 35:47.320
I haven't asked anything yet.

35:47.320 --> 35:48.840
Why are you feeling guilty?

35:48.840 --> 35:49.970
Did you see it or not?

35:50.320 --> 35:51.200
With your figure,

35:51.200 --> 35:53.110
even if I saw it,
I would pretend I didn't.

35:53.110 --> 35:54.170
It's just average.

35:54.470 --> 35:55.330
Not that great.

35:56.470 --> 35:57.150
Fine.

35:57.170 --> 35:58.770
So you did see it, didn't you?

35:58.920 --> 36:00.200
Are you schizophrenic?

36:00.200 --> 36:01.240
Why on earth am I living

36:01.240 --> 36:02.510
with someone like you?

36:06.400 --> 36:08.200
I wasn't asking about my figure.

36:08.280 --> 36:09.610
I meant the other parts!

36:10.320 --> 36:13.920
I've sent a team to
negotiate with the owner

36:13.950 --> 36:16.410
of the Weibo account
that posted the survey.

36:16.430 --> 36:17.760
No matter what it takes,

36:17.840 --> 36:20.200
we must get them to take it down.

36:21.430 --> 36:22.720
I want answers.

36:23.800 --> 36:25.000
It's been five hours,

36:25.160 --> 36:26.630
and you haven't even found the person.

36:26.630 --> 36:28.490
Is this what you call efficiency?

36:29.240 --> 36:30.040
Of course,

36:30.360 --> 36:32.760
I didn't call this meeting
to blame anyone.

36:33.470 --> 36:34.660
First, I admit

36:34.720 --> 36:36.200
that my previous judgment was wrong.

36:36.200 --> 36:37.200
Now I realize

36:37.280 --> 36:40.010
the previous leaks targeting
the hotel industry

36:40.030 --> 36:41.030
were just appetizers.

36:41.030 --> 36:43.050
Combined with this one, it's clear

36:43.150 --> 36:45.680
that this is a premeditated leak

36:45.720 --> 36:47.120
targeting Shanlifang.

36:47.240 --> 36:49.550
What this account and the team behind it

36:49.550 --> 36:50.780
will do next

36:50.920 --> 36:52.250
is completely unknown.

36:54.470 --> 36:55.770
So the top priority

36:55.840 --> 36:57.400
is that we must find a countermeasure

36:57.400 --> 36:58.840
to quell the public opinion.

36:58.840 --> 37:01.030
Calling you all to a meeting at this hour

37:01.030 --> 37:02.360
is really a last resort.

37:04.110 --> 37:05.570
I'm counting on everyone.

37:06.030 --> 37:06.600
Yeah.

37:06.920 --> 37:08.840
Gathering all of you from
the joint sponsor team here

37:08.840 --> 37:09.970
at this hour was also

37:10.030 --> 37:12.550
because we want to
hear your valuable opinions.

37:12.550 --> 37:14.680
Whatever helps Shanlifang

37:14.680 --> 37:16.340
get through this crisis,

37:16.590 --> 37:18.200
we can surface it

37:18.280 --> 37:19.540
and discuss together.

37:20.760 --> 37:23.240
As for these two videos, at present,

37:24.150 --> 37:25.280
I think they were most likely made

37:25.280 --> 37:27.400
by our competitors in the hotel industry.

37:27.400 --> 37:29.840
But they have already affected

37:29.840 --> 37:30.920
Shanlifang Hotel's

37:30.920 --> 37:31.990
IPO process.

37:32.070 --> 37:35.400
So the top priority right now
isn't digging for the truth,

37:35.680 --> 37:37.610
but quelling the public opinion

37:37.720 --> 37:39.720
and quickly minimizing the impact.

37:39.800 --> 37:40.380
Right?

37:43.400 --> 37:44.560
I actually think

37:44.880 --> 37:46.940
if we want to advance the IPO process,

37:47.430 --> 37:50.890
digging for the truth
and restoring the company's reputation

37:50.920 --> 37:52.250
are equally important.

37:52.360 --> 37:53.110
Otherwise, you see,

37:53.110 --> 37:55.060
once this public outcry dies down,

37:55.240 --> 37:57.390
the next one will soon stir up.

37:57.590 --> 37:59.030
So my suggestion is

37:59.150 --> 38:02.150
a two-pronged approach,
doing both simultaneously.

38:03.400 --> 38:04.800
What do the others think?

38:08.240 --> 38:09.100
Director Wang?

38:11.880 --> 38:14.720
I am more aligned with
Director Fang's suggestion.

38:14.720 --> 38:16.590
Investigating the truth at this time

38:16.590 --> 38:18.720
will inevitably consume a lot of
manpower and resources.

38:18.720 --> 38:20.160
What we need to do now

38:20.280 --> 38:21.580
is gather all our energy

38:21.580 --> 38:23.350
to deal with this public outcry.

38:23.350 --> 38:25.430
If we investigate the truth right now,

38:25.430 --> 38:27.800
we might be spreading our energy thin.

38:28.990 --> 38:30.630
I'm not asking if you agree.

38:30.720 --> 38:32.180
I'm asking for a solution.

38:37.800 --> 38:40.450
Actually, in this age of social media,

38:40.880 --> 38:42.560
you can't cover up the news.

38:42.590 --> 38:45.400
So before we come up with a better idea,

38:45.760 --> 38:47.840
I am wondering if we could
use an even bigger news

38:47.840 --> 38:49.460
to cover this up.

38:51.200 --> 38:52.400
Even bigger news?

38:53.280 --> 38:55.470
I understand what Director Fang means.

38:55.470 --> 38:57.620
These netizens who are
jumping on the bandwagon to attack us

38:57.620 --> 38:58.880
are not truly interested in

38:58.880 --> 39:00.630
the facts and the whole story
of this matter.

39:00.630 --> 39:02.220
They have a lot of pressure

39:02.320 --> 39:03.520
in their daily lives.

39:03.680 --> 39:04.610
They surf the internet

39:04.610 --> 39:06.650
mainly because they like gossip.

39:08.470 --> 39:09.320
Gossip?

39:13.990 --> 39:15.990
Shanlifang has no shortage of that.

39:22.990 --> 39:24.320
I have something to say.

39:26.560 --> 39:27.600
I think

39:27.630 --> 39:29.280
we shouldn't use gossip to distract people

39:29.280 --> 39:30.540
or change the subject,

39:31.150 --> 39:33.880
but instead,
let them vent their emotions first,

39:33.920 --> 39:35.880
and then face their mistakes head-on.

39:35.880 --> 39:37.950
With the most sincere attitude
and apology,

39:37.950 --> 39:40.150
we could buy time to ease public opinion,

39:40.150 --> 39:43.680
and eventually correct the mistakes
and resolve the conflict.

39:46.550 --> 39:47.950
That makes a lot of sense.

39:48.240 --> 39:49.680
You really are
an investment banking elite.

39:49.680 --> 39:52.570
You hit the nail on the head
and make perfect sense.

39:52.990 --> 39:53.800
How about this?

39:53.800 --> 39:55.430
Ask Director Fang from He Jing Securities

39:55.430 --> 39:57.260
to reorganize your job scopes.

39:58.160 --> 40:00.880
As for your role on the
Shanlifang joint sponsor team...

40:00.880 --> 40:02.030
We don't need you for now.

40:02.030 --> 40:03.080
Why?

40:17.990 --> 40:19.150
Please leave.

40:19.470 --> 40:21.200
We need to continue the meeting.

40:21.200 --> 40:23.330
Your status does not allow you to stay.

40:39.630 --> 40:41.760
Dai Xi, these are the materials
I prepared before the meeting.

40:41.760 --> 40:43.150
You might find them useful.

40:43.150 --> 40:45.410
Especially the content after page four.

41:19.200 --> 41:19.880
Let's continue.

41:19.880 --> 41:22.340
Let's see if anyone has
any other good ideas.

41:37.010 --> 41:45.920
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

41:45.110 --> 41:45.640
Qian Fei.

41:47.280 --> 41:48.140
Director Fang.

41:53.150 --> 41:55.250
Mr. Kong just called me
before the meeting.

41:55.250 --> 41:57.590
I was planning to go back to
He Jing tomorrow

41:57.590 --> 41:59.250
and try to fight for you again.

41:59.630 --> 42:01.600
But I didn't expect

42:02.240 --> 42:03.880
Liao Shiyu to ask you to leave directly

42:03.880 --> 42:05.080
at the meeting today.

42:07.590 --> 42:08.590
I know.

42:08.990 --> 42:09.840
I understand.

42:10.200 --> 42:12.240
Ms. Liao bypassed you

42:12.400 --> 42:13.880
and went straight to Mr. Kong.

42:13.880 --> 42:15.610
There was nothing you could do.

42:15.990 --> 42:17.470
It is a bit of a pity.

42:22.920 --> 42:25.030
It's okay. No need to rush.

42:25.590 --> 42:26.840
I'll try to figure something out.

42:26.840 --> 42:28.370
You go back and wait for now.

42:29.510 --> 42:31.060
Thank you, Director Fang.

42:31.510 --> 42:32.900
You should go back.

42:33.110 --> 42:35.040
I'll go down and pack my things too.

42:52.020 --> 42:53.850
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.200 --> 42:55.630
Look, we can only try to grab tickets now.

42:55.630 --> 42:56.620
From here to here.

42:56.620 --> 42:58.050
Let me help you look.

42:58.450 --> 43:00.180
There are tickets for this day.

43:03.990 --> 43:06.990
If I go back too early,
my dad will definitely overthink.

43:06.990 --> 43:09.290
I have a lot of confidence in Fulaxida.

43:07.370 --> 43:09.470
[Fulaxida Co., Ltd.]

43:09.670 --> 43:11.060
I have confidence too.

43:11.130 --> 43:13.110
I believe that in this era,

43:13.760 --> 43:15.200
outsiders can disrupt the industry

43:15.200 --> 43:16.270
and achieve a paradigm shift.

43:16.270 --> 43:17.200
What did you say?

43:17.230 --> 43:18.160
Paradigm shift.

43:19.070 --> 43:20.120
The previous line.

43:20.120 --> 43:22.180
Outsiders can disrupt the industry?
